# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Development-only units. The TEE simulator serves synthetic TDX quotes, so a
# production image that ever gained the unit must not also carry a preset line
# enabling it: dstack-rust-build.sh installing the unit and parity.json
# forbidding the binary are both independent of the preset.
enable dstack-tee-simulator.service
